{"4142590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Democracy Manifest", "steam_appid": 4142590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/37f1651baf2fcf4d2cc3c8eb71f77078.avif?t=1785317553\" width=600 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">How far are you prepared to go to pass a bill in this congress?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From lobbyism to crowd-rallying speeches, this <strong>round-based social deduction game</strong> will have you racking your brain about how to pick &amp; craft the best cards for your agenda and rig the following voting process in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There can be only one <strong>“POLITICIAN OF THE YEAR”</strong>, and to win the election, you’ll need to bring all your wits and social skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/b82f3f911bcaafe5dc14b25c3de45b23.poster.avif?t=1785317553\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/b82f3f911bcaafe5dc14b25c3de45b23.webm?t=1785317553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/b82f3f911bcaafe5dc14b25c3de45b23.mp4?t=1785317553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/1ce71849bf37fc04f95feea48cae28e7.avif?t=1785317553\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The stage is set for your very own <strong>political soap opera</strong>, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">so dress for the office, lie for the job and bring out your best smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you’re here to uphold tradition, drain the swamp or quietly become part of it, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">the <strong>Personality Processor</strong> has a suit and tie for every political animal and fashion crime imaginable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/c295ce35ff17311ec14975d60345c49c.poster.avif?t=1785317553\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/c295ce35ff17311ec14975d60345c49c.webm?t=1785317553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/c295ce35ff17311ec14975d60345c49c.mp4?t=1785317553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/0d30f0fe9f7ccaf3531842bf355c6ed1.avif?t=1785317553\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You decide which ideology your bills will serve. But don’t sweat it. What’s more important - a stable government or your own agenda?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Balance your visible and hidden<strong> ideology</strong> tags<strong> </strong>or prepare to make some backroom deals with competitors later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/2cea7421d370d8dd073ea7b57106bd1e.poster.avif?t=1785317553\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/2cea7421d370d8dd073ea7b57106bd1e.webm?t=1785317553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/2cea7421d370d8dd073ea7b57106bd1e.mp4?t=1785317553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/05c2ed20150a50eadc8304f9b78a34e7.avif?t=1785317553\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft intricate bills, <strong>trade powerful cards</strong> with other politicians or rely solely on your winning personality and shining <span class=\"bb_strike\">coin</span> <strong>smile</strong> to get into congress’s good graces. The United World Congress has its own ecosystem and you will learn how to navigate back room deals through <strong>espionage, bribery &amp; scams</strong> to make it out on top! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/bf3147d48e93e85aae67811471b49299.poster.avif?t=1785317553\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/bf3147d48e93e85aae67811471b49299.webm?t=1785317553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/bf3147d48e93e85aae67811471b49299.mp4?t=1785317553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/d7432cd6cfcac0eb58c683e7a5912842.avif?t=1785317553\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Round by round, play your cards right, stack bills, gain influence and trick your political enemies. Just remember <strong>the political tide can turn</strong> on you at any given moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/7e5ba6b004e950d9a9d1781f9543569e.poster.avif?t=1785317553\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/7e5ba6b004e950d9a9d1781f9543569e.webm?t=1785317553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/7e5ba6b004e950d9a9d1781f9543569e.mp4?t=1785317553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142590/extras/37f1651baf2fcf4d2cc3c8eb71f77078.avif?t=1785317553\" width=600 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">How far are you prepared to go to pass a bill in this congress?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" st